In the solution, the `OpenConnectionAsync` and `CloseConnectionAsync` methods are modified to use double-checked locking to ensure thread safety when opening and closing the database connection. This approach prevents unnecessary locking when the connection is already open or closed, improving performance in a multi-threaded environment.
